# Tasks Directory Structure Rules

**FOR ALL AI TASKS** - Follow this directory structure:

## Directory Organization

- **`/tasks`** - Use ONLY for test scripts and reports
- **`/tasks/PLAN`** - For task specifications (numbered files like `03-component-library-wiki.md`, `04-ai-setup-guides-network-nodes.md`)
- **`/tasks/PLAN/reports`** - For audits and reports
- **`/tasks/PLAN/scripts`** - For scripts
- **`/tasks/PLAN/errors`** - For errors

## File Placement Guidelines

- Test scripts and reports → `/tasks`
- Task specifications (numbered) → `/tasks/PLAN`
- Audit reports → `/tasks/PLAN/reports`
- Scripts → `/tasks/PLAN/scripts`
- Error documentation → `/tasks/PLAN/errors`
